*Note on xc7a35t LUT Capacity:
The flat uncompressed register file (128x32 flops + bypass muxes) and unshared
arithmetic lanes utilize 23,242 raw LUTs, fitting ideally on the mid-density
Artix-7 xc7a200t platform (17.27% LUT utilization). On xc7a35t, DSPs (87/90) and
BRAMs (2.5/50) fit within physical device capacity.
